# Used only by `npm run build:tauri` (vite build --mode tauri). Same
# reasoning as .env.capacitor: the desktop app bundles the web shell
# LOCALLY (tauri.conf.json has no devUrl/remote server pointing at
# anything but the local dist/), so there is no "same origin" backend the
# way a browser tab loaded from sustena.vyybandasky.online has. api.js's
# BASE defaults to '' (a relative path, correct for the hosted web app) --
# this makes every API call absolute instead, pointed at the real,
# currently-deployed engine.
VITE_API_BASE=https://sustena.vyybandasky.online
